---@class cloudflare.bot_management.PutBotManagementRequest
---@field zone_id string Identifier.
---@field ai_agents? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestAiAgents Configure blocking behavior for supported personal AI agents.
---@field ai_bots_migration_opt_out? boolean Temporary migration flag tracking zones opted out of AI bots managed-rule updates.
---@field ai_bots_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestAiBotsProtection|string Enable rule to block AI Scrapers and Crawlers.
---@field ai_search? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestAiSearch|string Configure robots.txt policy for AI search bots.
---@field ai_training? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestAiTraining|string Configure robots.txt policy for AI model training bots.
---@field ai_user? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestAiUser|string Configure robots.txt policy for AI assistant and agent bots.
---@field bot_preference_sync_enabled? boolean Enable Bot Preference Sync for this zone. When enabled, Cloudflare can serve robots.txt content derived from the zone's AI Search, AI User, and AI Training preferences.
---@field cf_robots_variant? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestCfRobotsVariant|string Specifies the Robots Access Control License variant to use.
---@field content_bots_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestContentBotsProtection|string Enable rule to block content bots. When enabled, blocks automated traffic with low bot scores, excluding safe verified bot categories. Exceptions should be managed via skip rules.
---@field crawler_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestCrawlerProtection|string Enable rule to punish AI Scrapers and Crawlers via a link maze.
---@field enable_js? boolean Use lightweight, invisible JavaScript detections to improve Bot Management. [Learn more about JavaScript Detections](https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/reference/javascript-detections/).
---@field fight_mode? boolean Whether to enable Bot Fight Mode.
---@field is_robots_txt_managed? boolean Enable cloudflare managed robots.txt. If an existing robots.txt is detected, then managed robots.txt will be prepended to the existing robots.txt.
---@field jsd_api_results_enabled? boolean Whether to use JavaScript Detection results submitted through the API for this zone.
---@field stale_zone_configuration? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestStaleZoneConfiguration A read-only field that shows which unauthorized settings are currently active on the zone. These settings typically result from upgrades or downgrades.
---@field using_latest_model? boolean A read-only field that indicates whether the zone currently is running the latest ML model.
---@field optimize_wordpress? boolean Whether to optimize Super Bot Fight Mode protections for Wordpress.
---@field sbfm_definitely_automated? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestSbfmDefinitelyAutomated|string Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on definitely automated requests.
---@field sbfm_static_resource_protection? boolean Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) to enable static resource protection. Enable if static resources on your application need bot protection. Note: Static resource protection can also result in legitimate traffic being blocked.
---@field sbfm_verified_bots? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestSbfmVerifiedBots|string Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on verified bots requests.
---@field sbfm_likely_automated? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateRequestSbfmLikelyAutomated|string Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on likely automated requests.
---@field auto_update_model? boolean Automatically update to the newest bot detection models created by Cloudflare as they are released. [Learn more.](https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/reference/machine-learning-models#model-versions-and-release-notes)
---@field bm_cookie_enabled? boolean Indicates that the bot management cookie can be placed on end user devices accessing the site. Defaults to true
---@field suppress_session_score? boolean Whether to disable tracking the highest bot score for a session in the Bot Management cookie.

