---@field fight_mode? boolean|distilled.Null Indicates that the zone's Bot Fight Mode is turned on.
---@field sbfm_likely_automated? string|distilled.Null Indicates that the zone's likely automated requests are being blocked or challenged.

---@class cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfiguration
---@field ai_agents? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationAiAgents|distilled.Null Configure blocking behavior for supported personal AI agents.
---@field ai_bots_migration_opt_out? boolean|distilled.Null Temporary migration flag tracking zones opted out of AI bots managed-rule updates.
---@field ai_bots_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationAiBotsProtection|distilled.Null Enable rule to block AI Scrapers and Crawlers.
---@field ai_search? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationAiSearch|distilled.Null Configure robots.txt policy for AI search bots.
---@field ai_training? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationAiTraining|distilled.Null Configure robots.txt policy for AI model training bots.
---@field ai_user? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationAiUser|distilled.Null Configure robots.txt policy for AI assistant and agent bots.
---@field bot_preference_sync_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Enable Bot Preference Sync for this zone. When enabled, Cloudflare can serve robots.txt content derived from the zone's AI Search, AI User, and AI Training preferences.
---@field cf_robots_variant? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationCfRobotsVariant|distilled.Null Specifies the Robots Access Control License variant to use.
---@field content_bots_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationContentBotsProtection|distilled.Null Enable rule to block content bots. When enabled, blocks automated traffic with low bot scores, excluding safe verified bot categories. Exceptions should be managed via skip rules.
---@field crawler_protection? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationCrawlerProtection|distilled.Null Enable rule to punish AI Scrapers and Crawlers via a link maze.
---@field enable_js? boolean|distilled.Null Use lightweight, invisible JavaScript detections to improve Bot Management. [Learn more about JavaScript Detections](https://developers.cloudflare.com/bots/reference/javascript-detections/).
---@field is_robots_txt_managed? boolean|distilled.Null Enable cloudflare managed robots.txt. If an existing robots.txt is detected, then managed robots.txt will be prepended to the existing robots.txt.
---@field jsd_api_results_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Whether to use JavaScript Detection results submitted through the API for this zone.
---@field optimize_wordpress? boolean|distilled.Null Whether to optimize Super Bot Fight Mode protections for Wordpress.
---@field sbfm_definitely_automated? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationSbfmDefinitelyAutomated|distilled.Null Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on definitely automated requests.
---@field sbfm_likely_automated? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationSbfmLikelyAutomated|distilled.Null Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on likely automated requests.
---@field sbfm_static_resource_protection? boolean|distilled.Null Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) to enable static resource protection. Enable if static resources on your application need bot protection. Note: Static resource protection can also result in legitimate traffic being blocked.
---@field sbfm_verified_bots? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationSbfmVerifiedBots|distilled.Null Super Bot Fight Mode (SBFM) action to take on verified bots requests.
---@field stale_zone_configuration? cloudflare.bot_management.UpdateResultSuperBotFightModeLikelyConfigurationStaleZoneConfiguration|distilled.Null A read-only field that shows which unauthorized settings are currently active on the zone. These settings typically result from upgrades or downgrades.
---@field using_latest_model? boolean|distilled.Null A read-only field that indicates whether the zone currently is running the latest ML model.

